---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Balloons Lane — how we collect, use and protect your information."
>
  <section class="post-hero">
    <div class="container"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="meta">Last updated: 2025</p></div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <div class="container post-body">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you request a quote or contact us, we collect your name, phone number, email address, event date and event details — only what we need to prepare your estimate and deliver your order.</p>
      <h2>How We Use It</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to quote requests and questions</li>
        <li>To schedule delivery and setup</li>
        <li>To send order updates (never spam)</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What We Never Do</h2>
      <p>We never sell, rent or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>This website may use basic cookies to improve your browsing experience. You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time.</p>
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>To review or delete your information, email <a href="mailto:balloonlaneny@gmail.com">balloonlaneny@gmail.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+17186752820">718-675-2820</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
